 "text": "Hey, great to hear from you. How are you? Definitely. A good camera can turn a good laptop into a great one, especially for things like video calls. Then a nice camera can save you money on a good microphone too. A decent camera gives you much clearer audio. You lose the built in backlight KVM switch, so you'd need separate monitor and a separate keyboard. It' also much larger. Then a compact webcam like the one on your laptop is probably fine. Use a thin Mount that sits on top of the monitor.",
